++/*-------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
++
++/* for the pxa27x, these can just wrap kmalloc/kfree.  gadget drivers
++ * must still pass correctly initialized endpoints, since other controller
++ * drivers may care about how it's currently set up (dma issues etc).
